  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "30MM カラバリグランプリより、投票上位アイテムの「ガルドノヴァ [グリーン]」が登場！",
      "en": "From the 30MM Color Variation Grand Prix, the top voted item \"Gardonova [Green]\" is now available!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 胸部装甲と長い可動式アームが特徴的な機体。",
      "en": "• A unique aircraft with chest armor and long movable arms."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 大型クローは組み替えで長さの調節が可能。",
      "en": "• The length of the large claw can be adjusted by rearranging it."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腰部に可動式のフロントアーマーを採用。",
      "en": "• Adopts a movable front armor at the waist."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 脚部の可動域も広く様々なポージングが楽しめる。",
      "en": "• The legs have a wide range of motion, allowing you to enjoy various poses."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 武装はサブマシンガンが付属。",
      "en": "• Armed with a submachine gun."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 量産機同士の合体機構を搭載。別売りの「レヴェルノヴァ」と合体すれば、重装甲機体を組み合わせて更に大型機体に。",
      "en": "• Equipped with a mechanism for combining mass-produced machines. If you combine it with \"Level Nova\" (sold separately), you can combine the heavily armored aircraft to create an even larger aircraft."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 既存機体やオプションパーツとのカスタマイズも可能。",
      "en": "• Can also be customized with existing aircraft and optional parts."
    }
  ],
